The PB206 ZigBee Panic Button sends a notification to your phone when pressed. It features low power consumption, easy installation and a mini size.

## Key Features

- ZigBee HA 1.2 compliant, compatible with other ZigBee products
- Press the panic button to send a notification to the phone
- Low power consumption
- Easy installation
- Mini size, 31g
- 1-year battery life with CR2450
